    <string name="health_explanation">RiseAlarm can read your sleep from Health Connect for the last 7 nights. It uses only the total sleep per night to show your average and sleep debt and to recommend how many cycles you need. These totals stay on your phone and watch.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_title">Your sleep data</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_details">Only sleep sessions are read — no other health data. RiseAlarm never writes to Health Connect and never sends anything to the developer or third parties. You can revoke access at any time in Health Connect; the planner then keeps working without a recommendation.</string>
